  "title": "Oven BBQ Chicken Drumsticks",
  "description": "Baked BBQ chicken legs are tender and juicy, with a crispy skin. A homemade BBQ sauce adds sticky goodness to these meaty drumsticks that are oven-baked instead of grilled.",
  "authors": [
