  "ingredients": [
    "6 chicken drumsticks",
    "0.33333334326744 cup ketchup",
    "0.33333334326744 cup white vinegar",
    "0.5 cup water, or more to taste",
    "0.25 cup brown sugar",
    "4 teaspoons butter, cut into small chunks",
    "1 teaspoon salt, or to taste",
    "2 teaspoons Worcestershire sauce, or to taste",
    "2 teaspoons dry mustard",
    "2 teaspoons chili powder, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Assemble ingredients, preheat oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C), and place drumsticks in a 7x11-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/reAdlLz7oG7sGPup87xjxkTyTV8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222932-OvenBBQChickenDrumsticks-mfs-step1-0200-3a03389b9ce543d69c08cbbc9056a42c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222932/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk ketchup, vinegar, water, brown sugar, butter, salt, Worcestershire sauce, mustard, and chili powder together in a bowl; pour mixture over drumsticks. Cover with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2_p79NSVkVY8uOssMzqmZN_9_0s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222932-OvenBBQChickenDrumsticks-mfs-step3-0205-b0327b6efa6a4925b45ab5fa00268d26.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222932/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, about 1 hour, turning chicken about halfway through. Uncover during the last few minutes of baking to let the skin crisp up and the sauce caramelize. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f7BrsgpOzReiGbZZViz4VBgS08I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222932-OvenBBQChickenDrumsticks-mfs-step4-0261-1e2b9a56d9744197ba5f604b1621ff1d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222932/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
